</a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@hpgroxanne）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455147569880785_20109896886af6aeb41f929.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-12 at 7.37.36 PM.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455147569880785_20109896886af6aeb41f929.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@hpgroxanne）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455147692783514_18026136786af6aeb57be50.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-12 at 7.37.32 PM.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455147692783514_18026136786af6aeb57be50.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@hpgroxanne）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455147831249851_5294527526af6aeb6a2405.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-12 at 7.37.33 PM.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455147831249851_5294527526af6aeb6a2405.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@hpgroxanne）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455147958233721_12630570796af6aeb81234b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-12 at 7.37.34 PM (2).jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455147958233721_12630570796af6aeb81234b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@hpgroxanne）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455148122142807_21074091436af6aeb9b6b88.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-12 at 7.37.34 PM (1).jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455148122142807_21074091436af6aeb9b6b88.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@hpgroxanne）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455148274420021_19682797086af6aebb8269c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-12 at 7.37.34 PM.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455148274420021_19682797086af6aebb8269c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@hpgroxanne）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455148498450346_15468424686af6aebd5852d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-12 at 7.37.35 PM (1).jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455148498450346_15468424686af6aebd5852d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@hpgroxanne）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455148609445320_10232573186af6aebe80308.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-12 at 7.37.35 PM.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455148609445320_10232573186af6aebe80308.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@hpgroxanne）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:57:31.321776+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1474,"images":19,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:31:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:51:31.199405+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:50:57.395635+00:00","content_hash":"91d63773d85fcd2068867a2e68da1d4ab2a32a0d0a5a1c3691f0d4359ef47dcd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}